  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Transfer Pricing &#x2013; Special Topics training (December 2025)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In-person 3-day tailored course on &quot;Transfer Pricing &#x2013; Special Topics&quot; held in Addis Ababa from 8 to 10 December. The training was attended by 22 participants from the Ethiopian Ministry of Finance and Ministry of Revenues, and covered key principles, methods, compliance requirements, and practical dispute-resolution approaches, combining theory with hands-on exercises and case studies.</narrative>
  </description>
